  "notes": "Source: https://www.mtggoldfish.com/deck/7942550 (downloaded 2026-09-14), estimated bracket 4+ — 15 game-changers (Force of Will, Cyclonic Rift, Rhystic Study, Fierce Guardianship, Deflecting Swat, Ancient Tomb, Cavern of Souls, Grim Monolith, Mana Vault, Mox Opal, Mox Diamond, Chrome Mox, Jeweled Amulet, Underworld Breach, Ragavan) — a Goldfish commander-meta top-10 archetype. Engine-risk cards the deck leans on: Vivi Ornitier's own mana-from-noncreature-spell-cast plus damage-ping trigger; free/alternate-cost spells (Force of Will, Pact of Negation, Commandeer, Disrupting Shoal, Mental Misstep, Flusterstorm, Snapback-free Gut Shot/Pyrokinesis); modal spells (Invert/Invent, Sea Gate Restoration, Valakut Awakening, Sundering Eruption, Boomerang Basics, Wild Ride, Secret Identity, Hydroelectric Specimen, Pinnacle Monk, Sink into Stupor, Virtue of Courage, Mistrise Village, Otawara, Redirect Lightning — most of these are MDFC dual-faced cards); slow-trip artifacts and baubles (Chrome Mox, Jeweled Amulet, Mishra's Bauble, Urza's Bauble); extra-turn-adjacent hazards (Alchemist's Gambit, Final Fortune, Last Chance); search-and-cast (Imperial Recruiter, Intuition, Gamble, Solve the Equation, Dizzy Spell, Merchant Scroll); the Rhystic Study/Mystic Remora 'may pay 1' tax ask.",
